ent-WFAsfClothingUniformColonist = ASF work uniform
    .desc = Hard-wearing purple fatigues with reflective bands, issued to the Federation's colonists.
ent-WFAsfClothingUniformResearcher = ASF field scrubs
    .desc = Soft purple scrubs for Federation researchers and medics. Easy to wash, which matters more than it should.
ent-WFAsfClothingUniformCasual = ASF off-duty uniform
    .desc = A purple jacket over dark trousers, for the hours when nobody needs anything from you.
ent-WFAsfClothingUniformMedic = ASF medical whites
    .desc = Clean whites worn in Federation clinics, where anyone who walks in gets treated.
ent-WFAsfClothingUniformFormal = ASF formal uniform
    .desc = A white dress shirt over purple trousers, for receptions and treaty signings.
ent-WFAsfClothingHeadBeretPlumed = ASF plumed beret
    .desc = A purple beret with a long white plume, a gift of the moth fleets that became part of the dress uniform.
ent-WFAsfClothingHeadCap = ASF peaked cap
    .desc = A dark peaked cap with a gold band, worn by Federation officers on duty.
ent-WFAsfClothingHeadHat = ASF brimmed hat
    .desc = A dark brimmed hat favoured by Federation envoys who would rather not be saluted.
ent-WFAsfClothingNeckCapelet = ASF capelet
    .desc = A short purple capelet with gold trim, worn over the shoulders on formal occasions.
ent-WFAsfClothingNeckCape = ASF envoy cape
    .desc = A long dark cape lined in purple and edged in gold. It marks whoever speaks for the Federation.
ent-WFAsfClothingOuterParade = ASF parade jacket
    .desc = A dark dress jacket with gold braid and purple piping.
ent-WFAsfClothingOuterRobe = ASF council robe
    .desc = A long dark robe with a purple stole, worn by those who sit on Federation councils.
ent-WFAsfClothingOuterEVA = ASF EVA suit
    .desc = A purple softsuit kept at Federation posts for rescue work outside the hull.
ent-WFAsfClothingHeadEVA = ASF EVA helmet
    .desc = The helmet of a Federation softsuit, with a wide visor so the person you are rescuing can see your face.
ent-WFAsfClothingShoesBoots = ASF boots
    .desc = Dark service boots, polished for inspections that rarely happen out here.
ent-WFAsfClothingHandsGloves = ASF gloves
    .desc = Long dark gloves issued with the Federation service uniform.
ent-WFAsfClothingBackpack = ASF backpack
    .desc = A sturdy grey pack with purple straps, standard issue across the Federation.
ent-WFAsfClothingBackpackSatchel = ASF satchel
    .desc = A dark satchel with a purple clasp, carried by Federation staff who travel light.
ent-WFAsfClothingBackpackDuffel = ASF duffel bag
    .desc = A roomy grey duffel with a purple strap, packed for long postings far from home.

ent-WFAsfDrobe = ASF drobe
    .desc = A Federation outfitter. Uniforms, coats and bags for members of the ASF.
wf-asf-drobe-ad-1 = Every member, one Federation. Dress the part!
wf-asf-drobe-ad-2 = Tailored for every species in the Federation.
wf-asf-drobe-ad-3 = Packed for a long posting? Duffels in stock.
wf-asf-drobe-ad-4 = The lantern stays lit. Your uniform should too.
